That seems strange that the monster would attack you while fleeing. The 
only thing I can think of is if it were confused or stunned, it may have 
attacked on accident while fleeing.

It's hard to know. IIRC a stethoscope will tell you their status (if you 
have one). If you use ranged weapons, you aren't a caitiff though, so if 
you really want to kill something you can throw stuff. Personally I 
don't worry about it; the penalty is -1 alignment each time, which is 
not all that much. Just try to avoid intentionally getting them running 
as you might with a Rogue.

